color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(160, 184, 66, 1), rgba(26, 26, 26, 1) 100%)","button_background":"","button_text_color":"","chart_background":"","chart_text_color":"","chart_true_false_color":""}},"multi_column_L8rENy":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"item_qkEqfb":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"4","title":"高可用基盤設計","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>FIDAクラウド上で冗長化構成を採用。安定稼働を実現。。<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_kieKXq":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"4","title":"スケーラブル設計","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>1店舗から数百店舗まで、<br\/>構成変更なしで拡張可能<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_iptgpM":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"4","title":"API \/ システム連携","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>POS・基幹・SOP・天候・外部データと柔軟に連携。<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_AgUNRa":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"4","title":"データセキュリティ","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>アクセス制御・暗号化・監査ログ標準搭載。企業向け設計。<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}}},"block_order":["item_qkEqfb","item_kieKXq","item_iptgpM","item_AgUNRa"],"name":"Multi-column","settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":true,"gap":"medium","text_alignment":"start","subheading":"","title":"エンタープライズ水準の基盤設計","content":"<p>多店舗展開を前提に設計された、安定性・拡張性・セキュリティ。<\/p>","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"content_width":"80ch"}},"image_with_text_overlay_4FrbBQ":{"type":"image-with-text-overlay","blocks":{"subheading_cpLm77":{"type":"subheading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"Subheading"}},"heading_3M3qnJ":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"Image with text overlay","heading_tag":"h1"}},"richtext_7hxgGB":{"type":"richtext","disabled":true,"settings":{"content":"<p>Use this text to share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, share announcements, or welcome customers to your store.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_cpLm77","heading_3M3qnJ","richtext_7hxgGB"],"name":"Image with text overlay","settings":{"full_width":true,"allow_transparent_header":false,"enable_parallax":true,"image_size":"md","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Platform_Image_3200x1600px.jpg","mobile_text_position":"place-self-center text-center","desktop_text_position":"sm:place-self-center sm:text-center","text_color":"#ffffff","overlay_color":"#000000","overlay_opacity":30}},"multi_column_iPQptJ":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"item_ahR3xN":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"2","title":"導入プロセス","heading_tag":"h3","content":"<h5>01. 要件整理（シンプル）<\/h5><p>現在利用中のPOS・人事・在庫形式を確認。<br\/>既存CSVに合わせることも、Flow標準形式の利用も可能。<br\/>原則、特別な開発は不要。<\/p><h5>02. データ接続<\/h5><p>APIまたはFTP（CSV）連携に対応。<br\/>接続状況は管理画面から直接確認・管理可能。<\/p><h5>03. 初期環境構築<\/h5><p>契約後すぐに管理画面を提供。<br\/>店舗・ユーザー設定を進めながら数値整合性を確認。<br\/>既存業務を止めません。<\/p><h5>04. 段階導入（推奨）<\/h5><p>3〜5店舗・同一エリア配下での導入を推奨。<br\/>学習効果を最大化し、成功モデルを確立。<\/p><h5>05. 全社展開<\/h5><p>エリア単位で成果確認後、本部基準を統一し全店舗へ展開。<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_AeBDja":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"2","title":"技術仕様ハイライト","heading_tag":"h3","content":"<h5>■ 更新頻度<\/h5><p>リアルタイム更新可能。<br\/>標準は1時間単位。10分更新にも対応。<\/p><h5>■ 対応スケール<\/h5><p>1000店舗規模まで拡張可能。<br\/>多店舗チェーンでの運用実績あり。<\/p><h5>■ データ保持<\/h5><p>長期トレンド分析に対応。<br\/>過去データのインポートも可能。<\/p><h5>■ システム設計<\/h5><p>クラウドベース／高可用性構成。<br\/>店舗数増加にも柔軟対応。<\/p><h5>■ セキュリティ<\/h5><p>アクセス制御<br\/>ログ管理<br\/>データ暗号化<br\/>SSO対応<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_EywArQ":{"type":"item","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"3","title":"Column title","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Pair text with an image to focus on your chosen product, collection, or blog post. Add details on availability, style, or even provide a review.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}}},"block_order":["item_ahR3xN","item_AeBDja","item_EywArQ"],"name":"Multi-column","settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":false,"gap":"medium","text_alignment":"start","subheading":"","title":"導入プロセスとスケーラビリティ","content":"<p>既存環境を活かしながら、段階的に導入可能。<br\/>多店舗チェーンの拡張にも耐える設計です。<\/p>","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"rich_text_xNbfkE":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"subheading_pPN4GR":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":"- - -"}},"heading_Dj3qJR":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"すべての意思決定は、正確な基盤から。","heading_tag":"h1","text_color":"","gradient":""}},"richtext_aUgUgm":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Flowは、店舗運営の「分析ツール」ではありません。本部と現場を同じ基準でつなぐ、意思決定の基盤です。<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_pPN4GR","heading_Dj3qJR","richtext_aUgUgm"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"full_width":true,"content_width":"large","text_position":"center","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}}},"order":["slideshow_XazT4w","rich_text_9wyNr6","rich_text_haqMr3","text_with_icons_FDLVaz","multiple_images_with_text_CnH68e","comparison_table_YMcB7K","multi_column_L8rENy","main","image_with_text_overlay_4FrbBQ","multi_column_iPQptJ","rich_text_xNbfkE"]}